SCOPE OF THE APACHE-2.0 GRANT

Everything in this repository is licensed under Apache-2.0, with one reservation
stated in advance so that it is never a surprise:

    Any content under an `enterprise/` directory, if such a directory exists, is
    licensed under the terms in `enterprise/LICENSE` and NOT under Apache-2.0.

No such directory exists today. The reservation is recorded now because it is
cheap to state before the fact and awkward to introduce after — a contributor
who submitted work believing the whole tree was Apache-2.0 is owed that
expectation. The same construction is used by LiteLLM and authentik, including
the "if such a directory exists" hedge.

The LICENSE file itself is the unmodified Apache-2.0 text and is deliberately
left that way, so that automated licence detection reads it correctly.
